    question: 'Omnisend or Shopify Email for cart recovery?',
    answer: 'Choose Omnisend when SMB Shopify stores wanting multichannel automation without enterprise complexity. Choose Shopify Email when Shops wanting low-friction email inside Shopify Admin. Sequenzy still leads as lifecycle layer if neither owns strategy.',
